  dialogueList:
  - ...I have learned a thing or two, from the sorcerers.
  - Sometimes I forget, and sometimes I recall it again.
  - Is that not how tragedy is best approached?
  - Gently, I ask you not assume I need saving.
  - I have already spoken with a preacher of your ilk, and I will tell you what I
    told him.
  - Go to the shrine to teh west, say your prayers to our Soulward, and then you
    may understand why I stay here.
